      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_4_NAME" "Hangar Afterparty"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_4_DESC" "Jiesuo 15 sou kewan feichuan, ranhou wancheng yici 250,000 fen paiming chuji. 进度计入：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught. 完成模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_5_NAME" "Boss Roster Stamped"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_5_DESC" "Zai shengya zhong jibai 8 ge butong Boss xinhao, ranhou wancheng yici 250,000 fen paiming chuji. 进度计入：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught. 完成模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_6_NAME" "Theme Park Panic"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_6_DESC" "Jingli 6 zhong butong chuji zhuti, ranhou wancheng yici 250,000 fen paiming chuji. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_7_NAME" "Two-Million Reactor"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_7_DESC" "Zai paiming moshi zhong dedao 2,000,000 fen. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_8_NAME" "Sector 30 Blackout"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_8_DESC" "Zai paiming chujizhong yi zhishao 250,000 fen dida di 30 qu. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_9_NAME" "Sector 50 Endless"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_9_DESC" "Zai paiming chujizhong yi zhishao 250,000 fen dida di 50 qu. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_10_NAME" "Ten-Boss Tribunal"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_10_DESC" "Zai yici 250,000 fen paiming moshi zhong jibai 10 ge shouling. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_11_NAME" "Clean Ten Statute"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_11_DESC" "Zai yici 250,000 fen paiming moshi zhong wancheng 10 ge wushang shanqu. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_12_NAME" "Thirty-Wave Ghost"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_12_DESC" "Zai yici 250,000 fen paiming moshi zhong wancheng 30 bo wushang zhandou. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_13_NAME" "Two-Hundred Hit Comet"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_13_DESC" "Zai yici 250,000 fen paiming moshi zhong dacheng 200 lianji. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_14_NAME" "Danger Dodge Prophet"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_14_DESC" "Zai yici 250,000 fen paiming moshi zhong lianxu wancheng 20 ci weixian shanbi. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_15_NAME" "Graze Storm Crown"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_15_DESC" "Zai yici 250,000 fen paiming moshi zhong chufa 12 ci Graze Break. 模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_16_NAME" "Full Hangar Omega"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_16_DESC" "Jiesuo quanbu 30 sou kewan feichuan, ranhou wancheng yici 250,000 fen paiming chuji. 进度计入：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade, 战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught. 完成模式：战术Arcade, 纯粹Arcade."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_17_NAME" "Three Wings"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_17_DESC" "跨多次游戏，用3种不同机体各清理2个星区。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_18_NAME" "Five Hull Salute"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_18_DESC" "跨多次游戏，用5种不同机体各击败一名首领。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_19_NAME" "Small Wings, Long Shadows"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_19_DESC" "跨多次游戏，用前5种机体中的3种各清理3个星区。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_20_NAME" "Five Opening Gambits"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_20_DESC" "跨多次游戏，用5组不同的三项初始强化各清理2个星区。 模式：战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_21_NAME" "Same Hull, New Plan"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_21_DESC" "跨多次游戏，用同一机体搭配3组不同的三项初始强化，各清理2个星区。 模式：战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_22_NAME" "Boss Ledger"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_22_DESC" "跨多次 Onslaught 游戏击败20名首领。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_23_NAME" "Serpent Survey"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_23_DESC" "跨多次游戏击败3种不同的太空蛇。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_24_NAME" "Field Research"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_24_DESC" "跨多次游戏，从击败首领后获得的选择中挑选10种不同强化。 模式：战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_25_NAME" "Fusion Conductor"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_25_DESC" "跨多次游戏，从首领后的强化选择中获得3种不同融合协议。 模式：战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_26_NAME" "Five Deep Flights"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_26_DESC" "在5次游戏中，每次至少清理5个星区。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_27_NAME" "Quiet Skies"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_27_DESC" "在5次游戏中，每次至少无伤清理3波敌人。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_28_NAME" "Hold the Line"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_28_DESC" "连续3次 Onslaught 游戏，每次至少清理2个星区。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_29_NAME" "Ten Sectors Beyond"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_29_DESC" "单次游戏清理10个 Onslaught 星区。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_30_NAME" "Three Boss Salute"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_30_DESC" "单次游戏击败3名 Onslaught 首领。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_31_NAME" "Five Clean Waves"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_3_31_DESC" "单次游戏无伤清理5波 Onslaught 敌人。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_4_0_NAME" "Serpent Duel"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_4_0_DESC" "单次游戏中，在最多损失1条命的情况下击败一条太空蛇。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_4_1_NAME" "Sparrow Against the Swarm"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_4_1_DESC" "单次游戏使用 Nova Sparrow 清理5个 Onslaught 星区。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_4_2_NAME" "Built Under Fire"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_4_2_DESC" "单次游戏中，从首领后的强化选择获得一次融合，并清理3个星区。 模式：战术Onslaught."
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_4_3_NAME" "Onslaught Constellation"
      "NEW_ACHIEVEMENT_4_3_DESC" "获得另外18项 Onslaught 成就。 模式：战术Onslaught, 纯粹Onslaught."
    }
  }
